    "Itemized Passive Description": "*Basic effect(s)*\n- Ki +3 and ATK & DEF 200%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- High chance of evading enemy's attack\n- \"Saiyan Saga\" Category allies' ATK & DEF 40%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- \"Bond of Master and Disciple\" Category allies' ATK & DEF 40%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*At the start of each turn*\n- {passiveImg:forever}ATK & DEF 50%{passiveImg:up_g} (up to 150%)\n*When there is an ally whose name includes \"Piccolo\"\n(Demon King, Majin Buu, etc. excluded) on the team*\n- {passiveImg:forever}ATK & DEF 100%{passiveImg:up_g} at the start of each turn\n(up to 300%)\n- Launches an additional attack that has a high chance of\nbecoming a Super Attack\n- Attacks are effective against all Types\n- DEF 200%{passiveImg:up_g} when receiving an attack\n*When there is an ally whose name includes \"Piccolo\"\n(Demon King, Majin Buu, etc. excluded) attacking in the same turn*\n- Great chance of performing a critical hit\n- Launches an additional Super Attack\n- Guards all attacks\n- Chance of evading enemy's attack 25%{passiveImg:up_g} temporarily\nwhen receiving a Super Attack\n*For every attack performed*\n- {passiveImg:forever}ATK 60%{passiveImg:up_g} (up to 300%)\n*For every attack received or evaded*\n- {passiveImg:forever}ATK & DEF 60%{passiveImg:up_g} (up to 180%)",
